# Goal: take the block called `block` (a letter, e.g. "B") from where it is now, and put it down with its
# centre at (x, y, z) in base_link, in metres. A block resting on the table has its centre at z = 0.325.
string block
float64 x
float64 y
float64 z
---
# Result: how it ended
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback: the step just finished
string stage       # open, above, descend, grasp, lift, transit, lower, release, retreat
